+# CLAUDE.md
+
+This file provides guidance to Claude Code (claude.ai/code) when working with code in this repository.
+
+## Project
+
+`shop-api` — a TypeScript API. The repo is at an early stage: right now it holds only `src/money.ts`. `package.json` lists no dependencies yet, so the scripts below need `tsx`, `vitest` and `eslint` to be installed before they run.
+
+## Commands
+
+- `npm run dev` — start the dev server with `tsx watch src/index.ts`. Note that `src/index.ts` does not exist yet.
+- `npm test` — run the test suite once with `vitest run`.
+- `npm test -- path/to/file.test.ts` — run one test file. Add `-t "test name"` to run tests whose names match.
+- `npm run lint` — run ESLint on the repo.
+
+Run `npm test` before pushing. CI also runs lint, so run `npm run lint` too.
+
+## Team rules (from CONTRIBUTING.md)
+
+- **Money is always integer cents.** Use the `Cents` type from `src/money.ts` and never use floats for money. `Cents` is only an alias for `number`, so the compiler won't stop a float from getting in. Keep all money math in integers and round on purpose at the edges, for example when parsing input or converting currency.
+- **Migrations:** never edit a migration that has shipped. Add a new one instead.
+- **`legacy/` is frozen:** only security fixes are allowed there. Don't refactor it or add features to it.
